# Liquid Glass Dark Icon Theme

## Artwork & Visual Design Sources
* macOSicons Community (https://macosicons.com): Liquid Glass application icon artworks crafted by the open community of macOS designers.
* macOS Design Guidelines: Inspired by Apple Inc. design language (macOS Big Sur, Monterey, Ventura, Sonoma, Sequoia, and Tahoe design concepts).
* System Glyphs & Status Bar Elements: macOS Tahoe status icons adapted for Linux desktop environments and panels.

